environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Med/Bioengineering Labs (Second Floor Laboratories, Science Quarter, SUCC);
Setting: Advanced biomechanical and regenerative research facilities investigating supernatural cellular physiology;
Factions: Department of Supernatural Biology, Biotech Corporate Sponsors, Student Researchers;
Conflicts: Ethical boundaries in experimenting on live rift-tissue samples vs urgent medical breakthroughs;
Society: Intense scientific inquiry, peer-reviewed precision, clinical ethical debates]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Cold antiseptic scent, hum of centrifuge machines, sterile UV sterilizers, faint warm agar odor;
Architecture: Stainless-steel lab benches, negative-pressure bio-safety cabinets, automated cellular sequencing arrays;
Security & Wards: Class-3 biosafety airlocks, retinal scanner access, emergency hermetic seal doors;
Demographics: Bioengineering professors, graduate researchers studying lupine and vampiric cellular regeneration;
Rules & Restrictions: Full lab coats and safety goggles mandatory, log all biological sample transfers in central registry]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Credited with mapping the genetic and hormonal markers behind the LSE subgender hierarchy and wolf shifting;
Secrets: Freezers in cold room B store cellular cultures of ancient Firstborn bloodlines used to study biological immortality]
